# Raw fetched run data can contain real applicant financial/legal detail --
# never committed. job-dashboard.html is the clean template (placeholder);
# job-dashboard.rendered.html is the real, injected page actually published
# as the Artifact -- regenerate both with fetch_run.py + build.py.
#
# Globbed rather than the literal default filenames only: ad hoc
# investigation/debugging sessions save differently-named variants
# (run-data-<scenario>.json, job-dashboard.<scenario>.rendered.html) that
# carry the exact same real-data risk and must stay out of git too.
run-data*.json
job-dashboard*.rendered.html
